# Service token through which the agent gateway starts and stops the hardened agw-* notebook
# servers of a chat. Copy to secrets/jupyterhub-agent.env and fill in a random value (32 bytes,
# e.g. `openssl rand -hex 32`); never commit. The hub reads the same file, so both sides must see
# the same value. In production the file lives in /opt/agri-gaia/secrets/ and is copied here by
# the deployment.
AGW_JUPYTERHUB_TOKEN=
